Des Visages des Figures: des Visages des Figures is an album by French rock band Noir Désir.  It was released in France and other European countries on 11 September 2001.  Manu Chao plays the guitar in "Le vent nous portera", among numerous musicians participating in the album.  All music was composed by Noir Désir, where not otherwise specified.  Lyrics are by Bertrand Cantat, where not otherwise specified.

